# The 1802 Series Servo Frame (43mm Width, for Standard Size Servos) as goBILDA sells it: the frame and its screws and its washers.
# Each is taken out of goBILDA's model of the whole of it (see 'structure/mount_servo_43mm_std_model' in partcad.yaml),
# so each is where that model has it, and all of them are placed at the origin.
links:
  - part: structure/mount_servo_43mm_std_frame
    name: frame
  - part: structure/mount_servo_43mm_std_screws
    name: screws
  - part: structure/mount_servo_43mm_std_washers
    name: washers
